          "text": "* Quartz crystal: motional arm (Lm, Cm = 16 fF, Rm = 30 ohm) parallel to C0 = 5 pF.\n.subckt XTAL 1 2 params: f=16meg\nLm 1 a {1/((6.2831853*f)*(6.2831853*f)*16f)}\nCm a b 16f\nRm b 2 30\nC0 1 2 5p\n.ends XTAL"
