      "sim": {
        "device": {
          "type": "subckt",
          "text": "* LM358: two op amps, output swings to V- and to 1.5 V below V+.\n.subckt LM358 inp_a inn_a out_a inp_b inn_b out_b vp vn\nXA inp_a inn_a out_a vp vn LM358_AMP\nXB inp_b inn_b out_b vp vn LM358_AMP\n.ends LM358\n* Generic op amp: open-loop gain aol, one pole at gbw/aol, slew rate sr (V/s),\n* output within vhi of V+ and vlo of V-, quiescent current iq.\n.subckt LM358_AMP inp inn out vp vn params: aol=1e5 gbw=1meg sr=0.3meg vhi=1.5 vlo=0.02 iq=0.35m\nRin inp inn 10meg\n.param imax={sr*1m/(6.2831853*gbw)}\nBg 0 int I = imax * tanh(v(inp,inn) * 1m / imax)\nRp int 0 {aol/1m}\nCp int 0 {1m/(6.2831853*gbw)}\nDhi int vp DCLAMP\nDlo vn int DCLAMP\nBo o 0 V = min(max(v(int), v(vn)+vlo), v(vp)-vhi)\nRo o out 50\nIq vp vn {iq}\n.model DCLAMP D(IS=1e-12)\n.ends LM358_AMP"
        }
